meta {
  name: 28 Accept Sample (creates report at Collection Center)
  type: http
  seq: 28
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/accession/order-samples/{{sampleId}}/accept
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{ccOperatorToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "sampleCondition": "Good",
    "notes": "Accepted for processing at the collection center"
  }
}

docs {
  **Accession - accept the sample** (COLLECTED -> ACCEPTED) at the Collection Center.
  Acceptance auto-creates the technician `LabReport` (status PENDING) with
  **`branchId = Collection Center`** - the report the machine fills, and whose branch
  is the "processing branch" the LIS gate checks. This is the report that will later
  be rehomed to Branch A by the transfer accept.
}
